      "quotedTweet": {
        "id": "2090049519836885154",
        "text": "This is now my fastest @Alibaba_Qwen 27B runner. Just using MTP at higher quant Q8_0 it’s 61 tok/sec beating my 5090 Q6_K 58 tok/sec\n\nNot bad for a 8 year old hardware, Volta V100 Nvlink-ed. PP is slower though at 725 tok/sec but this is almost 2x my DGX spark. https://t.co/i7kOz4WOLN",
